  "goodToKnow": "Die Ablagerung is a deposit or sediment: Kalkablagerungen (limescale, a big issue in hard-water regions like Munich and Frankfurt, hence regular Entkalken), Ablagerungen in den Blutgefäßen, geological Ablagerungen. Sich ablagern means to settle or be deposited. Wine and cheese that need to age are also abgelagert. Plural: die Ablagerungen."
